<!DOCTYPE xdf>
<XDFFORMAT version="1.60">
  <XDFHEADER>
    <flags>0x1</flags>
    <deftitle>GS8604 20C0 Full 512K - WOLF4X v3 (2026-10-07), English</deftitle>
    <description>Bosch GS8.60.4 (ZF 5HP19, software 20C0, 512 KB, program label B223K_0520C0 at 0x6FF7C), Motorola 68k CPU32. Calibration 0x70000-0x71BC0 and 0x78000-0x7D858, pointer catalog 0x71BC2 (43 slots), three CRC-16 sums (loader 0x0-0x43FF -&gt; 0x5FFE, program 0x8000-0x6FF7B -&gt; 0x6FFFE, calibration 0x70000-0x7FFCD -&gt; 0x7FFFE): after editing in TunerPro run tools/gs860_crc.py fix. Generated from catalog/gs8604_20c0.json by tools/make_xdf.py, never edited by hand. Confidence: proven = read by 20C0 code (instruction address in the proof), structure = same place in a structure as in 19D0 with the role proven there, unknown = shape proven, role not established, hypothesis = not proven. Roles of the shift-automaton record fields (sets 9820-983C) and of the root 0xFFFF9804 (drive engagement) are proven by 20C0 code. Roles of the D / S / M matrices are proven by 20C0 code and a log (D = k14 and k6, S = k11 and k15, M = k10, k8 at overheat; document 11 section 5), so are the warm-up program (0x25182), kick-down (0x1BC9C) and the lower TCC level (root 0xFFFF9808). RU text is the reference (catalog field description).</description>
    <author>rudywolf (WOLF4X)</author>
    <baseoffset>0</baseoffset>
    <REGION type="0xFFFFFFFF" startaddress="0x0" size="0x80000" regionflags="0x0" name="Binary File" desc="" />
    <CATEGORY index="0x0" name="01 Shift points (matrices k0-k15)" />
    <CATEGORY index="0x1" name="02 Program selection and AGS (not TCC)" />
    <CATEGORY index="0x2" name="03 Torque converter lock-up (TCC)" />
    <CATEGORY index="0x3" name="04 Shift: on-coming element, phases and pressure (set 9824)" />
    <CATEGORY index="0x4" name="05 Shift: off-going element (set 9828)" />
    <CATEGORY index="0x5" name="06 Shift: times and thresholds (set 9820)" />
    <CATEGORY index="0x6" name="07 Shift: slip controller (set 9834)" />
    <CATEGORY index="0x7" name="08 Shift: engine torque reduction (set 9838)" />
    <CATEGORY index="0x8" name="09 Shift: third element, EDS 1, offsets (sets 982C, 9830, 983C)" />
    <CATEGORY index="0x9" name="10 Drive engagement on selector change (root 9804)" />
    <CATEGORY index="0xA" name="11 Records and 98xx roots: role not established" />
    <CATEGORY index="0xB" name="12 Protections and temperature" />
    <CATEGORY index="0xC" name="13 Voltages (diagnostics)" />
    <CATEGORY index="0xD" name="14 Signals: pedal, speed, lever" />
    <CATEGORY index="0xE" name="15 Structures (not tables)" />
    <CATEGORY index="0xF" name="16 Not decoded (shape from the scanner)" />
  </XDFHEADER>
  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x2000" flags="0x0">
    <title>Shift points: matrix k00, program P4 (0x7120E)</title>
    <description>Values = output shaft rpm / 32 (compared with [0xFFFF9138] at 0x20688 up and 0x206E4 down). Columns 1-4 upshifts 1-2 ... 4-5, columns 5-8 downshifts 2-1 ... 5-4. Row Y = gearbox pedal, 255 = kick-down. The matrix is selected by 0x20768 by program number. With the converter locked the upshift threshold gets the offset 0x70B98 (0x20D8E).</description>
